                    with invert and speed options saved to Choices. Fixed a blank
                    display caused by unaligned/wrong-endian protocol stream reads
                    and a Norcroft 16-bit write-back codegen bug, and a launch
                    failure from a DeskLib bitfield struct-layout mismatch. Base
                    port 0.88 by Andrew Sellors; scroll-wheel and 32-bit changes
                    (C) 2026 Andrew Youll.
